            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>A roller assembly for a cargo loading system, comprises: a roller having an outer surface; a housing (204) radially inward from the outer surface; a first side plate (122); a second side plate (124) disposed opposite the first side plate, the roller disposed between the first side plate and the second side plate; a first tension strap (126) extending from the first side plate and the second side plate, the roller disposed adjacent to the first tension strap; a brake arrangement (240) retained within the housing; and an axle assembly (210) disposed at least partially within the housing, the axle assembly configured to apply a compressive force to the brake arrangement.</p>
            </abstract>
